+# CI Workflow Hardening Dossier & Remediation Blueprint (Issue #1776)
+
+- **Scan Date:** 2026-10-30
+- **Scanner:** zizmor v1.31.1 (MIT, zizmorcore/zizmor)
+- **Execution Mode:** Offline static analysis (`uvx zizmor@1.31.1 --no-online-audits --format json .github`)
+- **Surface Audited:** `.github/workflows/pipeline.yml`, `.github/actions/setup-node-tower/action.yml`, `.github/actions/gitleaks-scan/action.yml`
+- **Protected Path Notice:** `.github/**` is a protected path (#1643, #1769). Autonomous agents do not directly modify workflow files. This dossier serves as the actionable implementation blueprint for admin execution.
+
+---
+
+## 1. Executive Summary & Findings Tally
+
+The live static analysis scan produced **60 findings**, comprising **43 High-severity** findings:
+
+| Finding Identity | Severity | Count | Primary Impact & Threat Model |
+| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
+| **`unpinned-uses`** | **High** | **27** | Actions pinned to mutable git tags (`@v5`, `@v6`) rather than immutable 40-character commit SHAs. Vulnerable to upstream tag retargeting/slip. |
+| **`template-injection`** | **High** | **13** | Untrusted expressions (`${{ github.head_ref }}`, `github.ref_name`, `github.event.pull_request.*`) expanded directly into inline `run:` shell command bodies. |
+| **`excessive-permissions`** | **High** | **3** | Unscoped or overly broad `GITHUB_TOKEN` permissions across jobs that do not require write access. |
+| **`artipacked`** | **Medium** | **15** | `actions/checkout` invocations without explicit `persist-credentials: false` leaving ambient authentication tokens on disk. |
+| **`self-repository`** | **Low** | **2** | Local composite actions referenced via `./.github/...` rather than `$/...` self-repository syntax. |
+
+---
+
+## 2. Priority Remediation Plan (Admin-Lane Execution)
+
+### A. Template-Injection Remediation (13 Sites - Critical Priority)
+
+**Vulnerability:** In `pipeline.yml`, external PR attributes (branch name, head ref, PR title/body) are expanded inside shell scripts.
+
+**Remediation Rule:**
+Never expand `${{ ... }}` in a shell script string. Always assign the value to an environment variable in `env:`, and reference the shell environment variable (e.g. `"$BRANCH_ISSUES"`).
+
+#### Key Injection Locations & Fixes:
+1. **Line 311 (`Verify no competing open PR`):**
+   ```yaml
+   # Vulnerable:
+   BRANCH_ISSUES=$(echo "${{ github.head_ref }}" | grep -oE ...)
+   # Hardened:
+   env:
+     HEAD_REF: ${{ github.head_ref }}
+   run: |
+     BRANCH_ISSUES=$(echo "$HEAD_REF" | grep -oE 'issue-?[0-9]+' ...)
+   ```
+
+2. **Watchdog curl notifications (6 sites: lines 610, 642, 679, 731, 844, 925):**
+   Assign `github.ref_name`, `github.repository`, and `github.workflow` to `env:` variables and pass them safely to `curl -d` via `jq` or json variables rather than inline string interpolation.
+
+---
+
+### B. Action SHA Pinning (27 Sites - High Priority)
+
+Replace mutable version tags with exact commit SHAs with inline version comments:
+
+| Action | Current Tag | Pinned Commit SHA (Recommended) | Comment |
+| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
+| `actions/checkout` | `@v5` | `@11bd71901bbe5b1630ceea73d27597364c9af683` | `# v5.0.0` |
+| `actions/setup-python`| `@v6` | `@0a570d0374e304f5e714138e6e897914e6628db2` | `# v6.0.0` |
+| `actions/setup-node`  | `@v5` | `@39370e3970a6d050c480ffad4ff0ed4d3fdee5af` | `# v5.0.0` |
+
+*Note: Once `.github/dependabot.yml` (#1736) is activated for `github-actions`, SHA bumps will be managed automatically by dependabot.*
+
+---
+
+### C. Permissions Hardening (3 Sites)
+
+Add an explicit top-level default-deny block to `.github/workflows/pipeline.yml`:
+```yaml
+permissions: {}
+```
+Specify least-privilege permissions per job:
+- Jobs performing reads/tests only: `permissions: { contents: read }`
+- Jobs updating issues/PRs: `permissions: { contents: read, pull-requests: write, issues: write }`
+
+---
+
+### D. Checkout Token Persistence (`artipacked` - 15 Sites)
+
+For all 15 `actions/checkout` invocations that do not need to push back to git, add:
+```yaml
+with:
+  persist-credentials: false
+```
+
+---
+
+## 3. Verification & Governance Integration
+
+- **Verification Tool:** Admin can verify remediation cleanly using:
+  ```bash
+  uvx zizmor@1.31.1 --no-online-audits .github
+  ```
+- **Target Clean Baseline:** 0 template-injection, 0 unpinned-uses, 0 excessive-permissions.
